WEBVTT

00:01.109 --> 00:05.849
♪I'm not going to lose,
because I believe in myself♪

00:05.849 --> 00:10.889
♪I'll do whatever it takes
to protect that miracle♪

00:10.889 --> 00:20.649
(Even Given the Worthless "Appraiser" Class,
I'm Actually the Strongest)

00:20.999 --> 00:25.179
♪A fleeting dream I had is falling now♪

00:25.719 --> 00:29.489
♪The loneliness remains as my power♪

00:30.649 --> 00:34.579
♪To a life that is drifting away♪

00:34.579 --> 00:37.829
♪The magic sprinkles upon♪

00:39.209 --> 00:43.969
♪I pick up the fragments
and tightly tether them♪

00:43.969 --> 00:48.629
♪I always keep them as
my source of strength in my heart♪

00:48.629 --> 00:50.899
♪See the world through my eyes♪

00:50.899 --> 00:53.319
♪And you'll get your treasure♪

00:53.319 --> 00:58.729
♪Let's go around the world and find it out♪

00:59.929 --> 01:04.309
♪I'm not going to lose,
because I believe in myself♪

01:04.789 --> 01:09.349
♪Everything's possible
I've overcome a lot so far♪

01:09.349 --> 01:14.329
♪Because you have given it to me♪

01:14.329 --> 01:21.188
♪I'll do whatever it takes
to protect that miracle, for good♪

01:38.650 --> 01:40.613
What's wrong, Ein?

01:46.746 --> 01:47.880
Monsters...

01:47.882 --> 01:50.140
A massive horde is coming straight for us!

01:54.303 --> 01:57.491
No matter how many enemies there are,

01:57.493 --> 01:59.127
I'll defeat them all!

01:59.129 --> 02:02.629
I won't let a single one
lay a finger on this village!

02:08.772 --> 02:10.383
What a horde...

02:13.088 --> 02:15.149
If they flood in like that...

02:15.149 --> 02:18.428
This wall won't hold.
They will destroy the village.

02:19.689 --> 02:21.899
What should we do, Ein?

02:24.097 --> 02:25.641
Is this the end?

02:26.279 --> 02:28.302
We're going to be
killed by the monsters...

02:28.995 --> 02:30.786
It's over...

02:32.789 --> 02:36.083
Mia was so happy that you saved me!

02:36.823 --> 02:38.603
I can finally start believing again.

02:39.048 --> 02:40.853
In hope, that is.

02:43.339 --> 02:45.035
Yuri, get inside my eye.

02:45.037 --> 02:45.829
Yes!

02:46.839 --> 02:49.012
Everyone, get back!

02:53.695 --> 02:56.441
I've promised to protect their smiles.

02:57.288 --> 03:01.485
I'll take them all down
no matter how many they are!

03:01.772 --> 03:04.479
Not even a single one of them
will touch the village!

03:04.781 --> 03:06.344
Spiral Bullet!

03:07.587 --> 03:09.919
We did it! The village is now...

03:18.543 --> 03:20.831
No dice. There's too many of them.

03:21.144 --> 03:23.744
We can't possibly take them all on!

03:37.380 --> 03:38.894
Super Appraise!

03:40.899 --> 03:42.291
Wind Edge!

03:43.899 --> 03:45.198
Lightning Flash!

03:52.789 --> 03:54.369
Gravity Breath!

03:59.292 --> 04:00.582
Spiral Bullet!

04:05.729 --> 04:06.969
Back Attack!

04:08.629 --> 04:10.139
Mirage Double.

04:11.369 --> 04:12.509
Steel Thread!

04:29.489 --> 04:31.175
A-Amazing...

04:34.882 --> 04:37.757
He took down that many by himself...

04:38.289 --> 04:42.422
If you keep fighting like this,
you're going to collapse first!

04:42.650 --> 04:44.549
Until I've taken them all down...

04:45.279 --> 04:47.525
I will not fall!

04:51.179 --> 04:52.985
Steel Cutter with...

04:54.288 --> 04:56.447
Expansive Slash!

04:57.191 --> 04:59.700
His attack range is
growing wider and wider!

04:59.702 --> 05:03.927
But no matter how strong you are,
continuing at this output is dangerous!

05:03.929 --> 05:05.370
Your body won't last!

05:06.821 --> 05:08.939
Even so, I...

05:11.389 --> 05:12.791
Ein!

05:13.497 --> 05:17.963
Even so, I won't back down!

05:18.588 --> 05:19.960
Drawing Strike!

05:38.054 --> 05:42.229
Ein! You really beat them all.

05:47.229 --> 05:48.679
Ein!

05:52.835 --> 05:56.829
I'm glad I managed to protect them all...

05:57.294 --> 05:58.463
Thank goodness...

05:58.982 --> 06:00.749
You don't have to say anything more.

06:00.751 --> 06:02.100
Let me heal you.

06:12.326 --> 06:14.719
Ein, what a man you are.

06:15.475 --> 06:18.505
The healing couldn't keep up,
his body was in tatters...

06:18.507 --> 06:21.394
Yet he still managed to take down
the horde by himself.

06:26.058 --> 06:27.930
Thank you, Yuri.

06:27.932 --> 06:29.359
What about the villagers?

06:29.359 --> 06:31.109
Dear God!

06:33.489 --> 06:36.239
Thank you so much, Lord Ein!

06:36.488 --> 06:40.489
You saved our village
not only once, but twice.

06:41.290 --> 06:42.322
Everyone.

06:43.889 --> 06:46.749
Are you sure we want to stay like this?

06:47.160 --> 06:49.249
What's gotten into you?

06:49.251 --> 06:54.297
Everyone, Ein protected us,
complete strangers.

06:54.616 --> 06:58.329
Even when in tatters,
he still fought for us by himself.

07:02.255 --> 07:04.232
And yet, what about us?

07:04.741 --> 07:10.154
All we do is curse our fate
and wait for our demise.

07:11.457 --> 07:13.649
Are we really okay with this?!

07:14.510 --> 07:16.229
Well...

07:16.229 --> 07:18.409
Our lord told us so...

07:18.720 --> 07:21.348
And that's how we've always given up!

07:21.674 --> 07:24.773
We've convinced ourselves
that fighting won't change a thing,

07:24.775 --> 07:26.426
and sacrificed others.

07:28.919 --> 07:30.884
You saw how Ein bravely fought for us.

07:30.886 --> 07:32.759
Didn't that move your heart at all?

07:32.761 --> 07:37.679
More than our lives,
he also protected our pride!

07:41.491 --> 07:44.679
You're right. We have to fight too.

07:45.069 --> 07:47.689
We're not staying like this!

07:47.689 --> 07:51.189
We'll take our future
into our own hands!

07:51.189 --> 07:54.389
Yeah!

07:54.689 --> 07:56.932
Ein, look!

07:56.934 --> 07:59.457
They have regained their spirit.

08:00.697 --> 08:02.699
Yeah. I'm so glad.

08:02.699 --> 08:06.079
Your efforts have reached them.

08:07.288 --> 08:09.079
I'm happy for you.

08:09.347 --> 08:13.087
Yuri, do you think I've gotten
a little closer to you?

08:13.089 --> 08:14.589
Huh?

08:14.589 --> 08:19.509
You saved me the first time we met.
Do you remember?

08:19.511 --> 08:21.194
However, that wasn't all.

08:21.561 --> 08:23.850
You also gave me so much.

08:25.847 --> 08:30.220
You gave me pride, confidence,
courage, warmth and many more.

08:30.875 --> 08:36.109
If I was able to share those with them,
perhaps I am getting closer to you!

08:36.109 --> 08:39.889
After all, I want to see what you see.

08:42.989 --> 08:45.044
Not in front of you nor behind you.

08:45.046 --> 08:48.497
I want to see what you see, by your side.

08:48.499 --> 08:50.295
Ein...

08:51.249 --> 08:54.749
Ah, young love...

08:54.749 --> 08:56.759
Wha...

08:59.192 --> 09:00.859
It's fine, it's fine!

09:00.861 --> 09:02.645
That is how young people should be!

09:02.647 --> 09:05.759
We've decided
to fight for our future too!

09:05.759 --> 09:09.269
Yeah! We won't let
Nigun control us anymore!

09:11.492 --> 09:13.519
What about me?

09:17.529 --> 09:19.029
Nigun...

09:22.502 --> 09:27.684
Nigun, just so you know, we are not
following you anymore!

09:27.686 --> 09:30.289
That's right! We're fighting back!

09:30.291 --> 09:33.172
You didn't protect us.

09:33.174 --> 09:34.549
Ein did!

09:36.172 --> 09:40.270
Can't you see
that you all are being deceived?

09:40.272 --> 09:44.037
Listen. Ein is a demon.

09:44.039 --> 09:45.048
Huh?

09:45.050 --> 09:48.609
Think about it. A mere human
can't take down a Hydra,

09:48.611 --> 09:53.067
let alone an entire horde of monsters.

09:53.380 --> 09:56.472
This was all part of his plan!

09:56.474 --> 10:00.569
His plan is to seize control of Rayshik!

10:00.569 --> 10:06.101
But don't worry.
As always, I will protect Rayshik!

10:06.577 --> 10:08.577
What the hell are you talking about?

10:08.579 --> 10:09.789
What?

10:10.575 --> 10:13.447
Ein is a demon,
and he's trying to take over?

10:13.455 --> 10:17.393
Even if that's true, it's still way better
than what we had until now.

10:17.395 --> 10:18.720
That's right!

10:19.408 --> 10:22.003
Wh-What are you all saying?

10:22.005 --> 10:25.142
It's for the sake of this territory...

10:26.287 --> 10:31.745
Say, Nigun. The Rayshik you're
trying to protect—are we in it?

10:33.740 --> 10:38.740
We don't need a leader
who's sacrificing his people.

10:40.740 --> 10:43.400
We need one that will fight beside us!

10:43.400 --> 10:45.500
Like your father did!

10:46.498 --> 10:47.798
Father?

10:58.480 --> 11:00.920
W-What is this?!

11:01.640 --> 11:05.140
My head! My head is...

11:06.080 --> 11:10.260
S-Shadow! Help me! Shadow!

11:10.650 --> 11:14.480
Why won't anyone believe me?

11:14.480 --> 11:16.150
Tell me, Shadow.

11:16.150 --> 11:20.160
What should I do?!

11:20.540 --> 11:21.700
That thing...

11:22.450 --> 11:23.410
Appraise!

11:25.695 --> 11:27.180
I can't read it!

11:27.182 --> 11:28.725
A Concealment skill...

11:28.727 --> 11:30.511
Just like with Zoid!

11:31.490 --> 11:34.986
Well then, looks like it's time.

11:34.988 --> 11:38.180
Time to move the pieces forward.

11:38.180 --> 11:41.180
Nigun! Let go of that mirror!

11:46.560 --> 11:49.377
Tell me, Shadow...

11:49.379 --> 11:51.361
What should I do?

11:51.363 --> 11:53.993
It's simple, really.

11:53.995 --> 11:57.061
Just do as I say, like always.

11:57.063 --> 12:00.959
Your pain and suffering,
all the hardships will be gone.

12:00.961 --> 12:04.227
O-Of course.

12:04.700 --> 12:07.460
You just have to kill them all.

12:07.460 --> 12:08.210
What?

12:08.651 --> 12:13.518
You don't need people
who won't listen to you, so kill them.

12:13.520 --> 12:15.960
Just like what you did to your father.

12:15.960 --> 12:18.970
Father was sick.

12:18.970 --> 12:20.890
Sick, you say?

12:21.805 --> 12:25.217
Let me tell you the truth.

12:26.598 --> 12:28.318
The truth?

12:31.555 --> 12:33.360
What do you mean?

12:33.360 --> 12:35.480
Prepare yourself, okay?

12:39.908 --> 12:41.866
Father!

12:44.102 --> 12:46.818
Isn't it time for a break?

12:47.693 --> 12:51.020
Nigun! I suppose it is about time.

12:52.520 --> 12:59.380
My, even the lord himself is helping us.
I feel like we don't deserve this.

12:59.380 --> 13:04.390
No, no. I'm merely doing what a fellow
resident should do, that's all.

13:04.390 --> 13:07.640
You are such an incredible man.

13:07.980 --> 13:09.553
Father is amazing!

13:09.554 --> 13:12.893
Everyone loves him,
yet he remains humble and unassuming.

13:12.895 --> 13:17.064
Someday, I want to become
a noble lord just like him!

13:18.150 --> 13:20.780
Let me help you too...

13:21.780 --> 13:23.780
Are you all right?

13:24.380 --> 13:29.320
Haha. I messed up again.

13:30.980 --> 13:33.790
Lord Nigun, your illness...

13:33.790 --> 13:38.550
Oh, I'm fine. My fever is already gone.

13:39.860 --> 13:43.550
Nigun, go play with your friends.

13:44.560 --> 13:47.060
But I...

13:47.060 --> 13:49.958
A child's job is to play.

13:49.960 --> 13:54.560
Go and have fun with your friends.
That's what you need right now.

13:55.260 --> 13:56.880
All right...

13:59.180 --> 14:03.570
Go! Go get him!

14:04.402 --> 14:06.915
Hey, can I join in?

14:07.702 --> 14:10.680
Ah, it's the lord's kid.

14:10.680 --> 14:12.330
Aren't you sick?

14:12.330 --> 14:16.330
Mom told me not to play with you
because your sickness is contagious.

14:16.330 --> 14:19.090
That's wrong. I'm not...

14:19.090 --> 14:21.840
Let's run away!

14:21.840 --> 14:24.340
I'm not sick.

14:24.340 --> 14:27.330
I just have a weak body...

14:27.332 --> 14:29.443
I won't spread any sickness...

14:30.696 --> 14:33.850
Have you heard the rumor
about Lord Nigun?

14:34.405 --> 14:37.860
That kid looks nothing like him, you see.

14:37.860 --> 14:39.205
He's weak and frail.

14:39.207 --> 14:42.860
Rumor has it he was actually
an abandoned child found in the Abysswood.

14:44.086 --> 14:45.552
Abandoned child?

14:57.200 --> 15:01.020
I'm not my father's real child...

15:01.020 --> 15:04.602
That's why I keep messing up.
That's why I'm weak...

15:04.604 --> 15:08.436
I can never be like him!

15:15.740 --> 15:18.340
You don't have to be like him.

15:19.823 --> 15:22.871
Just live as yourself,
however you want.

15:22.873 --> 15:25.780
There's no point
in comparing yourself to him.

15:25.780 --> 15:29.464
Who are you? Why are you here?

15:29.466 --> 15:32.040
And why do you look just like me?

15:32.502 --> 15:35.846
Man, you sure ask a lot.

15:35.848 --> 15:39.937
I'm Shadow.
I'm what people call an imaginary friend.

15:39.939 --> 15:42.050
Which means I'm your friend.

15:42.050 --> 15:44.800
My friend?

15:45.180 --> 15:49.646
Yeah, but keep me a secret between us two.

15:49.648 --> 15:53.560
I'll vanish if anyone finds out about me.
Can you keep that promise?

15:53.980 --> 15:56.310
Yeah! I can keep it!

15:56.940 --> 15:58.310
Good answer.

15:58.310 --> 16:02.320
This is the first time
I've ever had a friend!

16:15.820 --> 16:18.830
Hey, Shadow. What should
we play this morning?

16:18.830 --> 16:22.930
How about we have a race to
see who can fall asleep first?

16:22.932 --> 16:26.205
You just want to take a nap.

16:31.760 --> 16:34.161
Father, are you okay?

16:35.609 --> 16:38.071
Yep. I'm fine.

16:38.073 --> 16:40.702
Looks like I've been affected
by a monster's miasma.

16:40.704 --> 16:42.770
Thank you for worrying about me.

16:46.939 --> 16:48.650
Shadow...

16:48.652 --> 16:52.665
Father looks really tired.
I'm worried about him.

16:54.660 --> 16:58.280
I know of an herb
that can help with fatigue.

16:58.282 --> 17:03.420
Why don't you brew it into tea for him?
Check that plant encyclopedia over there.

17:03.712 --> 17:05.357
Okay, got it!

17:10.002 --> 17:11.180
That's the one!

17:11.182 --> 17:14.430
(Dokutame Grass — A perennial
herb from the Rayshik Territory,)
Dokutame grass... You're right!

17:14.430 --> 17:16.180
(known for its fatigue recovery
and body-strengthening effects.)
It says that it helps with fatigue!

17:16.180 --> 17:20.190
Thank you, Shadow!
This will make Father feel better!

17:20.715 --> 17:25.849
No problem. I'm your friend, after all.

17:26.783 --> 17:28.562
Here you go, Father.

17:28.564 --> 17:32.200
It's herbal tea made from brewing herbs.
It will make you feel better!

17:32.200 --> 17:35.971
For me? Thank you. I'll have some.

17:39.450 --> 17:43.460
Mmm, delicious!
I feel so much more energized!

17:47.800 --> 17:50.313
You are very kind, Nigun.

17:50.315 --> 17:53.437
Never forget that kind heart of yours.

17:53.439 --> 17:56.470
If you do, one day,
you'll surely become a great lord.

17:56.472 --> 17:58.506
Yes, Father!

18:02.165 --> 18:06.480
But Father's condition
kept getting worse day by day.

18:06.480 --> 18:10.990
That's why I brewed him
the tea every day,

18:10.990 --> 18:13.646
hoping he'd get better soon.

18:14.800 --> 18:18.652
Father, I've brought you
your tea again today...

18:21.090 --> 18:23.393
Father?

18:28.712 --> 18:32.510
Hey, how long are you gonna
sit there bawling, Nigun?

18:33.212 --> 18:38.102
Shadow. What am I supposed to do now?

18:38.465 --> 18:41.770
There's no way I can protect Rayshik...

18:42.637 --> 18:45.666
Well, you are still only half a man.

18:45.668 --> 18:49.020
But you got me, remember?

18:49.359 --> 18:54.706
I'll make up for what you lack.
I'll tell you everything you need to do.

18:54.708 --> 18:58.530
Together, we can do it.
Don't you think so, Nigun?

18:58.530 --> 19:01.451
Yeah, you're right.

19:01.453 --> 19:05.290
I'm not alone.
You're always by my side.

19:05.598 --> 19:10.300
I'm really glad you're here.
Thank you, Shadow.

19:10.300 --> 19:15.300
Of course! We're friends, after all.

19:16.885 --> 19:19.167
What was the truth?

19:19.695 --> 19:21.680
You still don't get it?

19:23.542 --> 19:28.000
You killed your father,
with your own two hands!

19:29.335 --> 19:30.832
Hey! Nigun!

19:33.943 --> 19:35.017
What's wrong with you?!

19:36.573 --> 19:39.200
Nigun! Get a hold of yourself, Nigun!

19:39.200 --> 19:43.200
Hey! Nigun!

19:43.200 --> 19:46.200
You're lying! It was sickness
that brought my Father to...

19:46.200 --> 19:48.526
Still trying to deny it?

19:48.528 --> 19:56.090
It wasn't medicine you were
desperately giving him—it was poison.

19:56.090 --> 19:59.590
It's not! The encyclopedia said
it was for fatigue recovery!

19:59.590 --> 20:03.100
Oh, that was my doing.

20:09.480 --> 20:10.440
(Dokutame Grass — A perennial
herb from the Rayshik Territory,)

20:10.440 --> 20:11.400
(known for its fatigue recovery
and body-strengthening effects.)

20:11.400 --> 20:12.310
(Dokudoku Grass — The entire plant contains
a small amount of poison; prolonged ingestion)

20:12.310 --> 20:13.230
(can cause respiratory distress and paralysis
of the heart and lungs, leading to death.)

20:14.060 --> 20:15.270
You...

20:15.272 --> 20:16.943
That's right!

20:16.945 --> 20:20.370
But hey, the "fatigue recovery" part
wasn't entirely a lie, was it?

20:20.370 --> 20:25.120
I mean, once you're dead,
you don't feel tired anymore!

20:27.113 --> 20:31.201
Also, remember when I told you that
Ein is a demon?

20:31.203 --> 20:32.429
That was also a lie.

20:33.880 --> 20:37.380
Ein isn't a demon.
I am the demon.

20:39.148 --> 20:41.940
I initially planned to
deceive your father

20:41.940 --> 20:45.590
and set up a human trafficking
route to the demon world.

20:47.140 --> 20:50.458
But he was way too cautious.

20:50.460 --> 20:54.520
You, on the other hand,
were so easy to manipulate.

20:54.520 --> 21:00.410
I put on a friend act, and you latched
on right away. You made it too easy!

21:00.410 --> 21:05.780
Thanks to you, I was able to send
tons of humans to the demon world.

21:05.782 --> 21:07.660
What are you saying?

21:07.660 --> 21:11.639
Man, what a pathetic father-son duo, huh?

21:11.641 --> 21:16.349
A stupid father was killed by his stupid son.
But hey, look on the bright side!

21:16.351 --> 21:21.639
Though you weren't blood-related,
you ended up resembling him in one way.

21:22.433 --> 21:31.193
With a body and mind as weak as yours,
you'd never fit to be a lord anyway!

21:35.440 --> 21:36.820
Nigun!

21:44.200 --> 21:47.200
Finally, we've become one, Nigun!

21:48.198 --> 21:51.458
That's not Nigun! Who are you?

21:51.460 --> 21:53.964
Allow me to properly introduce myself.

21:53.966 --> 21:57.840
I am a noble demon of the fifth rank,
Viscount Shadow of Illusions.

21:57.840 --> 22:01.720
Pleasure to meet you, hero.

22:01.720 --> 22:03.523
A demon?

22:09.768 --> 22:14.898
♪No matter what trials you face,
no reason to be in such a hurry♪

22:14.900 --> 22:19.900
♪The wind will never stop carrying on,
as long as you have faith in yourself♪

22:19.900 --> 22:22.320
♪Never give up, the future's just ahead♪

22:22.320 --> 22:25.410
♪Just like rock music that will never die♪

22:28.617 --> 22:30.370
♪Keep on, keep on strumming!♪

22:32.370 --> 22:37.130
♪There are only pointless things
I have to do on my list♪

22:37.130 --> 22:42.010
♪Even the sun of my burning heart
has now completely sank♪

22:42.010 --> 22:47.010
♪I have completely lost track
of my whereabouts♪

22:47.010 --> 22:51.810
♪I wonder where it goes
The very thing I once cherished♪

22:53.100 --> 22:55.560
♪I drowned in hustle and bustle♪

22:55.560 --> 22:57.020
♪In the midst of loneliness♪

22:57.020 --> 23:03.900
♪Every person is being
made aware of reality♪

23:05.990 --> 23:11.200
♪As I was reaching the out of reach
I wasn't sure if I saw a mirage♪

23:11.200 --> 23:15.870
♪As long as you have faith in yourself
The future is possible for you to change♪

23:15.870 --> 23:18.540
♪Even if rocks get in your way forward♪

23:18.540 --> 23:21.130
♪You must stick to your will
and see it through♪

23:21.130 --> 23:26.050
♪Even if, the worst, everything fails
There will definitely be another chance♪

